{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/968722-need-help-with-some-supernatural-npcs","id":968722,"title":"Need help with some Supernatural NPCs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-13T13:53:27-07:00","id":968722,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon10.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Need help with some Supernatural NPCs","content":"So, in my vampire game, my players casted a Divination ritual to find of other supernaturals in the area. Then they used another ritual to learn about them. 16 targets. In any case, this ritual also creates a link between the vampire and the target. So now we have 16 supernaturals who feel that someone/something is doing something evil to them (some ritual/magic). They are also capable of tracking this feeling to it's source.<br /> <br /> So now I'm looking to the forums to help me list these people and how will they react to the situation. I'm aiming towards 3-6 major splats, and the rest being minor supernaturals or stranger things (Wicked Dead types). So please, post your supernatural (the detailed the better) and how would he react to this strange feeling. Would he ignore it? Seek out the source? Run away? Do something of his own?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T14:46:43-07:00","id":968751,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I can give you a little something.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Com sci Venture</div></div> </div> </div></span></span><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ani 1 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">dom 1 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fort 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Int 3 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Str 2 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Pre 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Wits 3 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Dex 2 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Man 3</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Res 3 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sta 2 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Comp 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Computer(Databases) 3 Academics (Finances) 2 Politics 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Athletics 1 Brawl 1 Drive 1 Firearms 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Animal Ken 2 Empathy 1 Expression 3 Intimidate 1 Persuasion(Fast Talking) 3 Subterfuge 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Started out as a bright kid with a bright future. Began a startup software company that ebbed and flowed swallowing a few smaller less ruthless companies. Massing a small little nest egg, young and in good shape physically, financially, mentally he soon fell on the radar of his future sire. And then the world came crashing down. Every business decision suddenly became the wrong one. His company went under and he was made a silly offer. \u201cTeach me everything you know about this computing device, and I shall return you to your silcon throne\u201d And you were Embraced as a \u2018reward\u2019 for explaining computers to a century old corpse.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">These Nights: Telecommuting is the wave of the future. You have been working as a consultant for european and australian companies putting some money in the bank during your \u201cup\u201d time, working your own hours. Feeding on the good side of town. Still recovering from your fall but reconstructing the tower piece by piece.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Merits: Resources 2, Library 2 (computers), Haven 3 (1 security, 1 Space 1 Location) Anonymity 1<br /> <br /> Reaction::<br /> Feeling out contacts to figure if this was a local phenomenon or a crisis.</span></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Noble Nos</div></div> </div> </div></span></span><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Vig 1</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Of 1</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Night 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Int 2 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Str 3</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Pre 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Wits 2 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Dex 2 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Man 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Res 4 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sta 2 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Comp 3</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Academics (Finances) 3 Politics 3 Occult 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Athletics 1 Brawl 1 Weaponry(knife) 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Empathy 3 Expression 1 Intimidate 1 Persuasion 2 Socialize(high society) 2 Subterfuge 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">As part of a noble line you were next in line for a small fortune. Then an old lady walked into your father\u2019s office and demanded a debt repaid, for the good fortune she had given to the family. The debt; a son. Baba Yaga Taught you, Feed you, and Bread you for your unlife. You are Her son. As she reminds you again and again. She is not your mother. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">These Nights: You act as your Baba Yaga\u2019s enforcer, break man, and messenger. Those you Cow you eat. The unworthy are beneath your heel</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Merits: Mentor 1 Fast Reflexes 3 Language 1 Haven 1 Resources 1 Retainer 1 (Driver)<br /> <br /> Reaction:: Someone has seen you. You might need to break their legs</span></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Druggie </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Cele 1</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Aus 2</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fort 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Int 2</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Str 2 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Pre 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Wits 3 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Dex 3 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Man 3</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Res 2 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sta 2 </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Comp 3</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Medicine(drugs) 2 Science(chemicals) 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Athletic 2 Brawl 1 Drive 2 Firearms 2 Larceny 2 Weaponry 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Empathy(Motives) 2 Streetwise 2 Subterfuge 2 Intimidate 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Growing up on the poor side of town a run down slump, You have learned to be self reliant. But only slightly better than a highschool dropout. Gang life was the next step. Learned how to cook up some stuff. The word got around about Red Surrender. Your gang the Fangs went to war, with the Swords and Claws. Didn\u2019t win. And you seemed to lose the most. Your sire was a burn out addicted to the drugs flowing through her victims viens.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">These Nights: Strangely not all that much has changed for you, except for the not getting out of bed before sun down, but you schedule accordingly. They come in for a fix and you drink while they chase the magical unicorns, space eagles, dragon puffs. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Merits: Contacts 3 (Fences, Labs, Suppliers) Allies 1 (Fangs) Herd 2 (stupid rich kids) Resources 1 Trained Observer 1</span></span><br /> <br /> Reaction: Curiosity, is this weird acid trip?<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Placeholder","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11731-mercset","name":"MercSet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11731_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"277"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-13T22:13:08-07:00","id":969022,"title":"","content":"Thanks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I forgot to mention, that none of these can be vampires. However, I will use your suggested NPCs in different places, as I still need to flesh out quite a bit of my NPCs. So thanks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T04:16:23-07:00","id":969133,"title":"","content":"I hope this can help you.<br /> <br /> 1) Female Werewolf =&gt; Irraka Hunters in darkness =&gt; Hunter of &quot;low astrals&quot;<br /> <br /> Motto: &quot;There are spirits that feed on fear and disgrace. I will teach them what is fear and disgrace.&quot;<br /> Reaction: The feeling that she has become the prey of someone. Find this someone, and teach him who is the hunter.<br /> <br /> Str 2 Dex 4 Sta 2<br /> Int 2 Wits 3 Res 2<br /> Pre 2 Man 2 Com 2<br /> Athletics 2, Larceny 2 (break in), Brawl 3, Stealth 3 (follow prey, ambush), Survival 1<br /> Investigation 2, Ocult 2<br /> Streetwise 2, Intimidation 2, Subterfuge 2.<br /> Renown: Cunning 1, Purity 1, Glory 1<br /> Gifts: Eviscerate, Feet of mist, Hit and run, Honed senses.<br /> <br /> <br /> 2) Male Werewolf =&gt; Rahu Storm Lords =&gt; Pit Fighter<br /> <br /> Motto: &quot;Those who feed on the weak are weak themselves. Feed on me, if you dare!&quot;<br /> Reaction: &quot;Luna told me 'Someone is coming to feed on you, child'. I'll be waiting.&quot;<br /> <br /> Str 4 Dex 2 Sta 2<br /> Int 2 Wits 3 Res 2<br /> Pre 2 Man 2 Com 2<br /> Athletics 3, Brawl 4 (grapple), Stealth 2, Survival 3<br /> Investigation 1, Occult 2, Grafts 1<br /> Streetwise 2 (illegal fights), Intimidation 3 (command), Persuasion 1, Animal ken 1<br /> Renown: Purity 1, Honor 1, Wisdom 1<br /> Gifts: Killer instinct, Primal strength, Lay low the challenger, Gaze of the moon.<br /> <br /> <br /> 3) Male Mage =&gt; Mastigos Free Council =&gt; Psychologist<br /> <br /> Motto: &quot;Someone who wants to save everyone but cares nothing about himself is condemned to doom.&quot;<br /> Reaction: An increase of patients that are impassioned on the same type of beautiful estranger. That cannot be a coincidence...<br /> <br /> Str 2 Dex 2 Sta 2<br /> Int 3 Wits 3 Res 3<br /> Pre 2 Man 2 Com 3<br /> Athletics 1, Brawl 1 (self defense), Drive 1, Stealth 1.<br /> Academics 3 (psychology), Investigation 2, Medicine 1, Occult 3, Science 1, Computer 1.<br /> Animal ken 1, Empathy 3 (calm down), Persuasion 2, Socialize 1.<br /> Arcana: Mind 3, Space 2, Life 1<br /> Praxis: Read the depths<br /> Rotes: Know nature (1), Mental scan (1), Psychic domination (2), Mental shield (2)<br /> <br /> <br /> 4) Female Changeling =&gt; Fairest Chirurgeon/Brewer (double kith merit) =&gt; (made with the development documentation for 2nd edition) =&gt; Herbalist<br /> <br /> Motto: &quot;Some children are like tree sprouts, full of potential for a better future. I will not let you reap those sprouts.&quot;<br /> Reaction: &quot;The crones... the crones... the crones... they found me, they come for the children... not again, not again... I will not let the crones take the children and feed on them again!!!&quot;<br /> <br /> Str 1 Dex 3 Sta 2<br /> Int 3 Wits 2 Res 2<br /> Pre 3 Man 3 Com 2<br /> Stealth 2, Weaponry (knives) 2.<br /> Crafts 3, Medicine 3 (treat illness), Science 2 (Biology), Occult 2, Academics 1.<br /> Empathy 1, Persuasion 3, Subterfuge 2, Socialize 1<br /> Contracts (5 dots): Cloak of the elements (1), Changeling fate (1), Blessing of perfection (3).<br /> <br /> <br /> Hope it helps!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12340,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12340-dourden","user":"dourden","date":". 09-14-2016, 08:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12340-dourden","name":"dourden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T06:18:16-07:00","id":969176,"title":"","content":"That certainly helps <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Thank you. <br /> Looks like I have my major splat supernaturals done. (will throw in a Promethean myself) <br /> <br /> Now, if possible stranger/minor splats would be preferable <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-14T07:51:48-07:00","id":969228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Griautis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/968722-need-help-with-some-supernatural-npcs?p=969176#post969176\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now, if possible stranger/minor splats would be preferable <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div>